@startuml Scan2Word_Sequence_OCR
title Sequence Diagram - OCR Process

actor User
participant "Home Page" as Home
participant "API: /ocr/mistral" as OCRAPI
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Mistral Cloud" as Mistral

User -> Home : 1. Upload Image
Home -> User : 2. Show Preview
User -> Home : 3. Click "Nhận diện"
Home -> OCRAPI : 4. POST {imageBase64, fileName}
activate OCRAPI

OCRAPI -> DB : 5. Create UploadedImage\n   (status: processing)
OCRAPI -> Mistral : 6. POST OCR Request
activate Mistral

alt Mistral Success
  Mistral --> OCRAPI : 7. {pages: [...], confidence}
  OCRAPI -> DB : 8. Update UploadedImage\n   (status: processed)
  OCRAPI -> DB : 9. Create OCRResult
  OCRAPI --> Home : 10. {success, extractedText,\n   ocrResultId}
else Mistral Error
  Mistral --> OCRAPI : 7. Error Response
  OCRAPI -> DB : 8. Update UploadedImage\n   (status: failed)
  OCRAPI --> Home : 9. {error: ...}
end

deactivate Mistral
deactivate OCRAPI

Home -> User : 11. Show Extracted Text
User -> Home : 12. Edit Text
User -> Home : 13. Click Export DOCX
Home -> Home : 14. Create DOCX Blob\n   (Client-side)
Home -> User : 15. Download File

User -> Home : 16. Click "Xuất file"
Home -> OCRAPI : 17. POST {text, fileName,\n   fileType, ocrResultId}
activate OCRAPI
OCRAPI -> DB : 18. Create ExportFile
OCRAPI --> Home : 19. Success
deactivate OCRAPI

@enduml
